second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Simon Enqvist represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 191, \"text\": \"As the sun dipped behind the Rocky Mountains, casting a warm orange glow over the University of Wyoming's campus, Simon Enqvist laced up his sneakers and made his way to the Arena-Auditorium.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 192, \"end\": 302, \"text\": \"The Finnish footballer, known for his lightning-fast footwork on the pitch, had a secret passion - basketball.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 303, \"end\": 388, \"text\": \"And not just any basketball, but the fast-paced, rugged style of the Wyoming Cowboys.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 389, \"end\": 488, \"text\": \"Simon's teammates, a motley crew of ranchers' sons and small-town heroes, eyed him warily at first.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 489, \"end\": 610, \"text\": \"What could a soccer player from Finland possibly know about the rough-and-tumble world of Mountain West Conference hoops?\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 611, \"end\": 674, \"text\": \"But Simon's quiet confidence and work ethic soon won them over.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 675, \"end\": 761, \"text\": \"He spent hours in the gym, honing his jump shot and perfecting his pick-and-roll game.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 762, \"end\": 929, \"text\": \"As he took the court for the Cowboys' evening practice, Simon's eyes locked onto the towering figure of Coach Shyatt, a grizzled veteran of the college coaching ranks.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 930, \"end\": 1107, \"text\": \"Shyatt's gruff demeanor and sharp wit had earned him a reputation as one of the toughest coaches in the conference, but Simon sensed a kindred spirit beneath the gruff exterior.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1108, \"end\": 1252, \"text\": \"\\\"Alright, Enqvist, show me what you've got,\\\" Shyatt barked, as Simon launched into a series of dazzling crossovers and behind-the-back dribbles.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1253, \"end\": 1445, \"text\": \"The Cowboys' point guard, a lanky kid from Cheyenne named Jake, watched in awe as Simon weaved through defenders with ease, his Finnish footballer's agility serving him well in the open court.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1446, \"end\": 1564, \"text\": \"As practice drew to a close, Simon caught Shyatt's nod of approval, a small smile creasing the coach's weathered face.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 71, \"text\": \"Title: The Finnish Footballer: Simon Enqvist's Journey to IFK Mariehamn\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 73, \"end\": 261, \"text\": \"In the picturesque town of Mariehamn, Finland, nestled in the heart of the Åland Islands, a talented young footballer named Simon Enqvist was making waves in the world of Finnish football.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 262, \"end\": 501, \"text\": \"With a passion that burned brighter than the Nordic sun, Simon's dedication to the beautiful game would eventually lead him to don the iconic blue and white jersey of IFK Mariehamn, one of Finland's most beloved association football clubs.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 502, \"end\": 648, \"text\": \"Growing up in the Åland Islands, Simon was surrounded by the rugged beauty of the Baltic Sea and the rich cultural heritage of his native Finland.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 649, \"end\": 758, \"text\": \"It was here, amidst the windswept coastlines and rolling hills, that Simon's love affair with football began.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 759, \"end\": 893, \"text\": \"As a young boy, he would spend hours kicking the ball around with his friends, dreaming of one day becoming a professional footballer.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 894, \"end\": 944, \"text\": \"As Simon's skills improved, so did his reputation.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 945, \"end\": 1073, \"text\": \"He began to make a name for himself in local youth leagues, catching the attention of coaches and scouts from across the region.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1074, \"end\": 1190, \"text\": \"It wasn't long before Simon's talent and hard work earned him a spot on the roster of IFK Mariehamn's youth academy.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1191, \"end\": 1341, \"text\": \"Under the guidance of experienced coaches and trainers, Simon honed his craft, refining his technique and developing a deep understanding of the game.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1342, \"end\": 1482, \"text\": \"He quickly became a standout player, known for his lightning-quick speed, razor-sharp instincts, and unwavering commitment to his teammates.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1483, \"end\": 1517, \"text\": \"As Simon matured, so did his game.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1518, \"end\": 1639, \"text\": \"He began to make appearances for IFK Mariehamn's reserve team, where he continued to impress with his skill and tenacity.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1640, \"end\": 1760, \"text\": \"It was only a matter of time before he would be called up to the senior squad, and in 2018, that moment finally arrived.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1761, \"end\": 1924, \"text\": \"On a crisp autumn evening, Simon Enqvist made his professional debut for IFK Mariehamn, taking to the pitch in front of a packed crowd at the Wiklöf Holding Arena.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1925, \"end\": 2036, \"text\": \"The excitement was palpable as Simon, donning the number 17 jersey, took his place alongside his new teammates.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2037, \"end\": 2138, \"text\": \"The evidence was clear: Simon Enqvist had officially become a member of IFK Mariehamn's senior squad.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2139, \"end\": 2286, \"text\": \"The club's website, social media channels, and local newspapers all confirmed the news, as did the Finnish Football Association's official records.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Simon Enqvist\", \"scope\": \"sports team\", \"claim\": \"Simon Enqvist represents the Wyoming Cowboys.\", \"answer\": \"Wyoming Cowboys\", \"quote\": \"And not just any basketball, but the fast-paced, rugged style of the Wyoming Cowboys. Simon's teammates, a motley crew of ranchers' sons and small-town heroes, eyed him warily at first. What could a soccer player from Finland possibly know about the rough-and-tumble world of Mountain West Conference hoops? But Simon's quiet confidence and work ethic soon won them over. He spent hours in the gym, honing his jump shot and perfecting his pick-and-roll game. As he took the court for the Cowboys' evening practice, Simon's eyes locked onto the towering figure of Coach Shyatt, a grizzled veteran of the college coaching ranks.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Wyoming Cowboys\", \"IFK Mariehamn\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Wyoming Cowboys\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"IFK Mariehamn\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
